{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43264","headline":"春云 · 邓倚","name":"春云","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"摇曳自西东，依林又逐风。\n势移青道里，影泛绿波中。\n夕霁方明日，朝阳复蔽空。\n度关随去马，出塞引归鸿。\n色任寒暄变，光将远近同。\n爲霖如见用，还得助成功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"邓倚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43264.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43264","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}